   "confidence": 5,
   "missing": ""
  },
  "Q3": {
   "answer": "Does in-domain performance predict zero-shot (no target-domain fine-tuning) generalization across diverse retrieval tasks and domains, and which of five architecture families generalizes best under this setting?",
   "locations": [
    "\u00a71 \u00b64-5",
    "Abstract"
