  "Q7": {
   "answer": "In-domain does not predict zero-shot: BM25 (0.228 on MS MARCO) is competitive out-of-domain. Average vs BM25: BM25+CE +11% (best, wins 16/18), ColBERT +2.5% (2nd), DocT5query +1.6% (wins 11/18), TAS-B \u22122.8%, GenQ \u22123.6%, ANCE \u22127.4%, SPARTA \u221220.3%, DeepCT \u221227.9%, DPR \u221247.7% (worst). Term-reweighting fails to transfer; document expansion and cross-attention generalise.",
