  "Q8": {
   "answer": "There is a performance/cost trade-off: BM25+CE is best but >350ms latency (100-candidate cross-encoder); dense models are 20-30x faster (<20ms GPU) but weaker; ColBERT needs ~20GB per 1M docs (~900GB for BioASQ's 15M vs 18GB for BM25); DocT5query keeps BM25's 0.4GB index and speed while improving generalisation.",
